WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:11.860
MOBILE SUIT
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY</b>

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:30.060
After infiltrating Cronicle's battleship,

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:34.900
Üso and Odelo encounter both Shahkti and Üso's mother,

00:01:34.930 --> 00:01:37.730
and manage to get Shahkti out.

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:43.500
The Motorad Fleet intensifies its firepower...

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:46.400
...as it aims for the North American continent.

00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:48.800
MOTHER, RETURN TO THE EARTH

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:52.200
"Mother, Return to the Earth".

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:13.960
Gather up anything you can scavenge!

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:18.200
Run final maintenance on your own mobile suits!

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:28.830
We'll repair our resupplied equipment as we head for the dock at point AC21!

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:35.330
We won't be able to remake this land into someplace habitable...

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:38.230
...so long as we haven't crushed the resistance of...

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:41.500
...the League Militaire and the Federation Forces.

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:56.400
Haven't they finished the repairs on the V2?

00:02:56.430 --> 00:02:59.760
No, there's been no word from the Reineforce Junior.

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:02.600
Was that Motorad ship the only one that escaped into the sky?

00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:03.530
Yeah.

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:06.100
Okay, let's run the idling test on the main engine!

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:08.730
Do you hear me? Hurry up with the monitor check, too!

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:12.000
If only one Motorad ship flew away,

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:14.830
wouldn't Cronicle's fleet be below it?

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:18.100
Even if we know their position, there's a hostage aboard the enemy flagship.

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:23.600
And even if we recover Üso's mother, that won't stop the fleet.

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:26.530
We're resupplied, so we'll sortie again.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:28.230
Yes, by all means!

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:32.660
The Federation Forces will squeeze the Motorad Fleet from the left and right.

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:33.400
Yes, sir!

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:34.230
We're off!

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:36.630
Stop!

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:39.500
Shrike Team, move out! All hands, make ready!

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:42.260
Again? Wake up! They're launching!

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:45.500
You shouldn't let it keep bothering you.

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:47.860
But she's suffering on my account.

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:51.830
It's what my mom wanted. You understand that, right?

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:53.130
Yes, but...

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:03.060
The main objective of this operation...

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:05.600
...will be the rescue of our compatriot, Myra Miggelle.

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:06.800
Understood.

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:11.130
We have to stop the tire ships without blowing them up, right?

00:04:11.530 --> 00:04:12.600
Exactly.

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.430
Marbet, V1, here I go!

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:24.360
Odelo, Tomáš, cover us from the rear. Got that?

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:25.430
Roger!

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:26.960
Leave it to us!

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:30.800
Moving in from the front...

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:34.560
...are Federation Forces vessels that are assisting the League Militaire.

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:38.860
In short, I wish to keep the Reineforce Junior and Federation ships apart.

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:40.500
Got it, Operations Chief Pippiniden?

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:41.760
Roger.

00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:44.030
You're getting used to your role I see, Commandant.

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:46.800
Because my old senior classmate gives me good advice.

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:51.230
If that's how you feel, would you hear a request from me?

00:04:51.260 --> 00:04:52.230
What?

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:54.930
I'm sending you a man named Goz Barl.

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:58.230
Will you stand aside and let him handle things himself?

00:04:58.260 --> 00:05:00.060
"Handle things himself?"

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:01.730
It won't cause you any trouble.

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:03.930
I just want to silence the white suit...

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:07.660
...and the Reineforce Junior before the ceasefire is announced.

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:10.800
There've been rumors of a ceasefire with the Federation.

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:13.660
But we can't stop till the white one's been destroyed!

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:15.230
You don't approve of that, do you?

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:17.160
Of course I don't! Do it!

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:18.360
Yes, sir.

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:21.460
You've matured, haven't you, Cronicle?

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:27.000
This operation goes against my personal morality,

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:29.660
but if I'm the man for the job, I'll try and do it.

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:47.100
That boy is no longer simply our child.

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:51.960
He's too talented to simply be that.

00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:00.530
Ms. Myra Miggelle?

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:01.900
Yes?

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:04.300
Your son's friends are stubborn.

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:05.530
Stubborn?

00:06:05.660 --> 00:06:11.200
Thanks to you all, we may be facing the guillotine.

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:12.830
It couldn't be helped.

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:15.700
Call us guerrillas or Feds, if you like,

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:19.030
but you're still being delayed by irregular military forces.

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:23.130
Which is why I'm considering surrendering to the League Militaire.

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:24.600
You want to desert?

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:26.400
It's a good idea, right?

00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:30.760
If I just surrendered, the League Militaire wouldn't believe me.

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:32.700
So, come with me, please!

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:38.430
Odelo, Tomáš, you'll be covering us!

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:39.400
Roger!

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:42.400
Here they come! Üso, you're too far out ahead!

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:46.500
This time, I'm getting my mom back!

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:58.360
Begin bombing run!

00:07:05.630 --> 00:07:07.960
It's not stopping! I can't believe this thing!

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:11.630
This way.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:20.430
Miss Marbet! I'll go and stop the Adrastea, too!

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:22.300
Firing beams alone won't work!

00:07:22.530 --> 00:07:23.700
I know!

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:29.200
I won't let you do this, Üso!

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:31.960
Miss Katejina?!

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:38.130
Üso, don't you understand that...

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:41.360
...the League Militaire's attacks on us only prolongs the war?!

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:42.700
So do yours!

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:54.030
Pilot, not that I'm suspicious of you,

00:07:54.060 --> 00:07:57.230
but if you intend to surrender, show me some proof.

00:07:57.260 --> 00:07:58.300
Proof?

00:07:58.400 --> 00:07:59.600
Yes.

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:02.530
Otherwise, I'll just jump off, right now.

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:04.330
I understand. Watch!

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:08.300
What?!

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:11.000
The mobile suit deck's hatch has been destroyed!

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:12.130
On screen!

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:16.460
Do it please, Pilot.

00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:17.200
Right.

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:26.600
Üso, leave this to me!

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:28.060
Go help Odelo and the others!

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:29.160
Understood!

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:39.160
You think an attack like that will stop the Adrastea?!

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:42.360
Don't make me laugh! Deploy beam shield!

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:49.860
Odelo, we'll never stop it at this rate!

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:51.430
Tomáš, over there!

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:58.500
Tomáš, we'll use that dam! Üso, head for the dam!

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:01.200
Dam? There's a dam here?!

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:12.360
We can't use nukes, so we're using the dam instead?

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:15.100
Cony! Juca! Protect Odelo's team!

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:41.800
A large quantity of water is approaching the ship from ahead!

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:44.460
All hands, brace for impact! Deploy defenses!

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:02.200
Time after time, with your insolent tricks!

00:10:02.430 --> 00:10:04.800
Engines to full! Get us out of here!

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:09.360
Aren't you going to surrender?

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:10.930
Don't talk.

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:15.800
The fleet I've served on is being destroyed. Let me watch a little longer, please.

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:21.230
It still hasn't stopped?!

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:32.600
Those missiles were aimed at me, specifically!

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:35.560
I'll let you see the death of your son!

00:10:35.600 --> 00:10:38.600
And it will send a shock through the League Militaire!

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:51.430
Pilot! What are you doing?!

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:55.130
I was ordered to fight, using you as a shield!

00:10:55.160 --> 00:10:56.130
What?!

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:57.260
What?

00:11:00.100 --> 00:11:02.700
That normal suit... Mom?!

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:06.100
You call yourself a soldier, Pilot?!

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:07.830
If I destroy the Victory,

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:09.830
the League Militaire's morale will shatter!

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:11.260
It's against my morals,

00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:14.300
but for this operation to succeed, it can't be helped!

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:15.500
He's serious.

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:24.460
What should I do?

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:41.560
Üso, what are you doing?!

00:11:43.630 --> 00:11:47.030
Miss Marbet! Something weird's happening with V2!

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:51.430
What?! V2's stopped moving?

00:11:58.630 --> 00:12:00.260
I can confirm it, too!

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:03.430
They're using a human shield to manipulate Üso!

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:06.930
Dammit, Goz Barl!

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:08.800
He's using the lowest trick of all!

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:13.330
If we destroy the white suit, that just leaves the Federation to deal with!

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:17.000
Even if we don't, mass production of the Gundams will continue.

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:20.200
The Gundams... You're right.

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:24.230
How do I attack him and still save my mom?!

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:27.660
If you won't attack me, I'll attack you!

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:31.600
What are you afraid of?!

00:12:35.030 --> 00:12:36.830
What?! You're blocking me?!

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:41.560
There are some strategies you just don't use!

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:43.460
Did Commandant Cronicle order this?!

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:45.200
Cronicle's woman!

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:52.830
I'll take charge of the hostage.

00:12:53.030 --> 00:12:55.100
Protecting the ship comes first!

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:57.500
The commandant approved this operation!

00:12:57.530 --> 00:12:59.360
I don't take orders from you!

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:01.730
Where are you taking my mom?!

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:07.030
Be careful attacking that mobile suit!

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:08.460
If that's even possible...!

00:13:11.130 --> 00:13:12.900
I can't believe we're helpless!

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:20.060
What?!

00:13:20.100 --> 00:13:21.660
That Gundam, too!

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:24.330
Dodge it!

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:27.800
It dodged me?!

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:32.830
Stay away from me!

00:13:32.860 --> 00:13:35.060
This pilot's losing it!

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:37.100
He's going to end up crushing me!

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:43.560
Even if he is a pilot Pippiniden sent, is that the best he can do?!

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:46.560
What's the point in okaying this if he gets the hostage killed?!

00:13:46.600 --> 00:13:48.160
We need him to win, quickly!

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:51.160
And Goz Barl will need to be penalized.

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:55.030
Along with Pippiniden! My despicable senior classmate!

00:13:57.130 --> 00:13:59.930
Get away! Get away! Stay away from me!

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:04.800
If you're a mobile suit pilot, try fighting me fairly!

00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:11.230
You found my weakness, Gundam?

00:14:11.300 --> 00:14:12.230
What?!

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:20.730
Üso, get your mother!

00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:21.960
R-Right!

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:23.230
Mom!

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:27.060
Fight!

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:28.460
Mom!

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:35.330
If I lose using this plan, it really will mean the guillotine for me!

00:14:42.130 --> 00:14:44.330
He's caught on the enemy ship's gun turret?

00:14:45.930 --> 00:14:46.930
Üso!

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:52.360
Where's Katejina's unit?! Have her recover the hostage!

00:14:52.460 --> 00:14:54.300
This operation is a failure!

00:14:57.030 --> 00:15:00.000
What?! That's Goz Barl's unit?

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:04.760
Crushing a person in a mobile suit's hand?

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:06.330
It's a disgrace to our army!

00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:09.700
Even if the hostage is killed, I'll retrieve the corpse!

00:15:14.860 --> 00:15:16.530
He's caught up there!

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:18.100
How do we save her?!

00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:19.530
Don't ask me!

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:27.000
Mom!

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:28.600
Üso...

00:15:28.630 --> 00:15:31.000
Reach your hand out, and I'll save you!

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:35.960
This mobile suit... Miss Katejina?!

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:39.200
Stand aside! I can't let you have her!

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:45.430
You're a pilot! A soldier!

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:46.930
Forget about me!

00:15:47.230 --> 00:15:48.130
Mom?

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:55.000
Everyone, covering fire on Üso!

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:06.260
Shoot! Shoot!

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:10.800
Destroy all who would impede the Motorad Fleet's advance!

00:16:13.960 --> 00:16:17.800
The Motorad Fleet can't be beaten by the League Militaire!

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:21.500
Goz Barl, get out of there and get to a hatch!

00:16:22.230 --> 00:16:23.930
Move the cannon to make it easier to free himself.

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:24.860
Captain!

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:25.800
Sir!

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:29.360
Forget Goz. Katejina will find a way.

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:29.930
Sir!

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:34.360
Whether it's Pippiniden or Duker Iq who serves under him,

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:37.030
they need to see why the conquest of Earth...

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:39.700
...can't be achieved with just this fleet's brute strength!

00:16:46.660 --> 00:16:49.260
What's wrong with me taking back my mother?!

00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:52.430
Even if the hostage dies, I can't let you have her!

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:55.060
Miss Katejina, you've lost your mind!

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:58.500
Because you're stronger than any child should be!

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:03.660
I just want to save my mom!

00:17:06.430 --> 00:17:10.030
Dammit, if we can't stop the big one, we can at least stop this!

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:19.260
Don't topple!

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:21.460
I-It's no use! This is the best we can do!

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:22.760
Don't give up!

00:17:28.930 --> 00:17:30.800
Mom! Can you move?

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:35.600
It's no use. It's holding my waist too tightly.

00:17:35.630 --> 00:17:39.030
Then I'll cut the mobile suit's hand off with my beam saber!

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:43.130
Captain! Lift off and dodge the ship ahead of us!

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:44.830
Intensify anti-air fire!

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:47.700
A-Adrastea, coming up from behind!

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:49.360
Move forward to evade!

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:50.600
We can't!

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:52.630
All hands, brace for impact!

00:17:57.700 --> 00:18:00.800
The beam saber particles are too strong! They can kill a person!

00:18:00.830 --> 00:18:02.930
Just forget about me!

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:04.160
Don't say that!

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:10.100
Üso, behind you!

00:18:10.760 --> 00:18:11.760
Üso!

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:38.130
MOM!

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:53.660
Üso, stop!

00:18:53.700 --> 00:18:56.930
A nuclear blast could destroy everything here!

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:02.760
I'm disgusted!

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:05.460
I'll never think of that man as my senior again!

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:08.260
A ceasefire has been signed with the Federation?!

00:19:08.300 --> 00:19:10.860
You're certain?! What's going on?!

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:16.800
I just have to destroy that tire! Then it'll stop!

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:22.200
We finally got a laser communication line connected!

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:25.430
There's definitely a temporary ceasefire in effect.

00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:27.460
Of all the lousy timing!

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:31.300
What the hell are they thinking, back home?!

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:40.860
A white flag? They're surrendering?

00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:42.960
Cony, stop Üso!

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:46.430
They fought this far, just to be defeated?!

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:48.630
Surrender isn't the same as defeat.

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:52.430
But we can't attack a ship flying a white flag!

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:03.160
I see.

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:07.600
And what happened to the hostage held by Goz Barl's unit?

00:20:07.630 --> 00:20:11.330
She was apparently crushed by the Lysithea's rear tire.

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:14.800
You're saying the boy saw it?

00:20:15.660 --> 00:20:16.630
Probably.

00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:21.230
He could have seen it. That boy...

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:30.530
A-Are you kidding me?!

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:34.760
The Earth Federation and the Zanscare Empire signed a truce?!

00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:38.730
Jinn Jahannam doesn't recognize any truces or ceasefires!

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:40.430
Right, Captain?!

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:42.800
I agree. This is a trick.

00:20:42.830 --> 00:20:45.460
Zanscare is buying time.

00:20:45.530 --> 00:20:48.400
It's the only thing that makes sense. Am I wrong?

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:52.100
No, it was decided by the central government on the moon.

00:20:52.130 --> 00:20:55.700
The troops stationed on Earth apparently had no say in it.

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:56.630
Neither did we.

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:58.330
Üso and the others are back!

00:20:58.560 --> 00:21:01.730
Did he find anything of his mother's?

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:03.430
I hope so.

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:15.630
It's my fault! It's my fault she was killed!

00:21:15.930 --> 00:21:18.460
It's nobody's fault, Shahkti.

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:20.830
Right, Üso?

00:21:20.900 --> 00:21:22.830
I... don't really know.

00:21:23.730 --> 00:21:25.200
This is my mom.

00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:30.800
Üso...

00:21:39.430 --> 00:21:40.560
Let him be.

00:21:40.600 --> 00:21:41.560
Yeah...

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:53.500
Why couldn't they have just...

00:21:53.530 --> 00:21:55.930
...announced the ceasefire five minutes sooner?!

00:21:58.160 --> 00:22:03.000
Üso! I'll stay with you! Üso!

00:23:31.700 --> 00:23:34.360
We head back to Kasarelia,

00:23:34.400 --> 00:23:37.160
but the BESPA forces continue to chase us.

00:23:37.900 --> 00:23:40.400
The White Ark takes refuge on an island,

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:44.860
where the fish bones and smells frighten Martina and the others...

00:23:45.160 --> 00:23:49.500
...while Üso and the others face a hard battle at sea.

00:23:50.860 --> 00:23:53.860
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:54.130 --> 00:23:57.460
Next Episode TWINRAD COUNTERATTACK
"Twinrad Counterattack".

00:23:57.460 --> 00:23:58.900
Please watch it!

00:23:58.900 --> 00:24:00.130
